    Returns:
        {
            "words": [
                {
                    "text": "HELLO",
                    "confidence": 99.5,
                    "bbox": {
                        "x0": 0.1,  # Normalized 0-1 coordinates
                        "y0": 0.2,
                        "x1": 0.3,
                        "y1": 0.25
                    }
                },
                ...
            ]
        }

Bulk remove nodes from a session and handle associated task actions.

    Expected payload:
    {
        "session_id": "uuid",
        "node_ids": ["uuid1", "uuid2"],
        "task_actions": {
            "task_id_1": "remove_from_wo",   // soft-delete MappingTaskSession
            "task_id_2": "delete_task",       // soft-delete the task
            "task_id_3": "remove_nodes"       // soft-delete specific MappingTaskNode records
        }
    }

Apply a shortcut to a set of nodes, creating recurring tasks from the shortcut's procedures.

    Request body:
    {
        "node_ids": ["uuid1", "uuid2", ...],
        "procedure_due_dates": {
            "mapping_id_1": "2025-06-01T00:00:00Z",
            "mapping_id_2": "2025-06-01T00:00:00Z"
        },
        "procedure_last_completed": {  // Optional
            "mapping_id_1": "2024-06-01T00:00:00Z"
        }
    }

    Note: procedure_due_dates and procedure_last_completed use mapping_procedure_shortcut.id,
    not procedure.id, since a shortcut can have the same procedure mapped multiple times
    with different intervals.

Remove a shortcut (plan) from nodes by soft-deleting associated tasks.

    Request body:
    {
        "node_ids": ["uuid1", "uuid2", ...]
    }

