post.description:
Synchronously refresh and return the OCR identification signature
    for a single protective device.

    The asset-save flow already triggers extraction in the background;
    this endpoint is for the photo-viewer overlay button that lets a
    user pull a fresh signature on demand, or for backfill.

    Response (200):
    {
        "success": true,
        "signature": {
            "manufacturer": "...",
            "catalog_number": "...",
            "model_designation": "...",
            "amp_rating": "...",
            "extracted_at": "...",
            "source_photo_ids": ["..."]
        }
    }

    Or, if no nameplate photos exist yet:
    {
        "success": true,
        "signature": null,
        "skipped": "no_photos"
    }

