put.description:
Batch-apply labor rates across work orders, then re-generate the plan.

    Body:
      {
        "rules": [
          {"labor_type_id": "<uuid>", "rate_id": "<uuid>",
           "workorder_ids": ["wo-e-1", ...]  # optional; omit = ALL WOs using that labor type
          }
        ],
        "clear_existing": false   # true = discard current rate_overrides first
      }

    Each rule pins one labor type to one rate on the targeted work orders. The
    rate must belong to this company and match the labor type. Returns the new
    program totals + the number of (work order, labor type) pins applied.

